        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Cursed is he who does the work of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " with slackness; and cursed is he who keeps back his sword from bloodshed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Therefore, behold, the days are coming, says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", when I shall send to him tilters who will tilt him, and empty his vessels, and break his",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48.12",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk Aquila: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "their",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " jars in pieces. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Moab shall be ashamed of Chemosh, as the house of Israel was ashamed of Bethel, their confidence.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Judgment has come upon the tableland, upon Holon, and Jahzah, and Mepha-ath, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and Dibon, and Nebo, and Beth-diblathaim, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and Kiriathaim, and Beth-gamul, and Beth-meon, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and Keri-oth, and Bozrah, and all the cities of the land of Moab, far and near. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The horn of Moab is cut off, and his arm is broken, says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Make him drunk, because he magnified himself against the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; so that Moab shall wallow in his vomit, and he too shall be held in derision. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Was not Israel a derision to you? Was he found among thieves, that whenever you spoke of him you wagged your head?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Heshbon and Ele-aleh cry out;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48.34",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Cn: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "From the cry of Heshbon to Elealeh",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " as far as Jahaz they utter their voice, from Zoar to Horonaim and Eglath-shelishiyah. For the waters of Nimrim also have become desolate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will bring to an end in Moab, says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", him who offers sacrifice in the high place and burns incense to his god. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore my heart moans for Moab like a flute, and my heart moans like a flute for the men of Kir-heres; therefore the riches they gained have perished.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“For every head is shaved and every beard cut off; upon all the hands are gashes, and on the loins is sackcloth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On all the housetops of Moab and in the squares there is nothing but lamentation; for I have broken Moab like a vessel for which no one cares, says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "How it is broken! How they wail! How Moab has turned his back in shame! So Moab has become a derision and a horror to all that are round about him.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
